<title>USA: AmeriQuest to sell CMS assets to management.</title>
<headline>AmeriQuest to sell CMS assets to management.</headline>
<dateline>HOLLYWOOD, Fla. 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>AmeriQuest Technologies Inc said Tuesday that it has agreed to sell substantially all of the assets associated with its subsidiary, CMS Enhancements Inc to CMS management for an undisclosed amount.</p>
</text>
